Rules:
- Read-only. Do not comment, resolve, approve, push or change anything in GitLab or the worktree.
- Never start a CI pipeline or Cypress run.
- Read every comment on the MR, including top-level ones, not just threads. If anyone has set a condition for approving or merging (an E2E run needed, "hold off until X", waiting on another MR, an open question for @$me), say so. Check whether the condition is met yet.
- Threads marked "addressed" are resolved automatically, so be strict. Say addressed only when you've confirmed it in the code. Or say it when the author's reply gives a reason no change is needed and you've checked that reason against the code.

